/*
 * pure-circuit-pin.compact
 *
 * Pins an exported pure circuit for Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23.
 * Official: https://docs.midnight.network/compact/reference/compact-reference
 *           https://docs.midnight.network/guides/compact-javascript-runtime
 *
 * Related: midnightntwrk/servicedesk#249 reports that pure circuits declared
 * inside a contract type (interface) compile on compactc 0.35.0 but fail at
 * runtime with ModuleResolutionError kind PureInterfaceCircuit. That is a
 * newer-toolchain limitation outside this lab's ledger-8 pin.
 *
 * On the 0.31.1 pin, an exported pure circuit is available on pureCircuits
 * and does not require a circuit context. This file is source-only.
 *
 * LOCAL-TRUE. Not compiled or deployed here.
 * Does not claim a fix of the public indexer or node.
